From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nydal91 <nydal91@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 13:42:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 14/18] Add SGSR 1 upscaler backend for DX11, DX12 and Vulkan

Compute port of Snapdragon GSR 1's RGBA mode, sharing one shader between
FXC and glslang. It follows the frame's jitter and keeps HDR scene color
through a reversible tonemap, as upstream expects a display referred input.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01A9WqnwGsLAcGJXd49N2pes
